        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superbly located and well-maintained four-bedroom semi-detached property in Clontymon Lawn on the Boreenmanna Road in Ballintemple. The property is ideally located just off the South City Link Road (N27) and a short distance from Cork City Centre with all amenities. \r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a family home in a sought after and convenient location in a small mature development with a green. \r\n\r\nThe property is a four bedroom two-storey dwelling constructed in 1985 of masonry construction with a pitched concrete tiled roof. The property has front and rear gardens and off-street parking.  \r\n\r\nEntering the hallway the living room is on the right, family room to the left and kitchen/dining to the rear with utility and guest w.c.\r\nUpstairs the main ensuite bedroom is spacious and bright with two large windows overlooking the front garden and green. 3 double bedroom share a family bathroom. \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall, 2 Living Rooms, Kitchen/Dining Room, Utility, Guest W.C.\r\nFirst Floor: 4 Bedrooms, 1 Bathroom.\r\nFloor Area: 123m2\r\nSee the Floor plan for full details.\r\n\r\nThe rear west facing garden with a patio area is flanked with mature trees and is a haven in a city location. \r\n\r\nViewing recommended. \r\n\r\nMains Services, Oil Central Heating, PVC Double Glazed Windows. \r\nBER: C 119821502"
      },
